### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Ruta inexistente → 404
GET http://localhost:3000/no-existe

### Registro de paciente → 201
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

### Mismo email → 409
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

### Datos inválidos → 400 con detalle por campo
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "no-es-email", "password": "123" }

### Intento de registrarse como admin → 201, pero con role "patient"
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hacker@test.com", "password": "12345678", "role": "admin" }

### Contraseña incorrecta → 401
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "incorrecta" }

### Login correcto → 200 y cookie access_token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

### Usuario actual (usa la cookie del login) → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Logout → 204
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### Después del logout → 401
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me